Derivative works
----------------
The following files are modified versions of files from the upstream project
(both the copy under src/ and the deployment copy under patches/):

  - gateway/server.ts
  - gateway/metadata-env.ts
  - config.ts
  - core/tdai-core.ts
  - core/store/factory.ts
  - core/store/store-pool.ts
  - utils/manifest.ts
  - metadata/store/interface.ts
  - metadata/store/db-name.ts
  - metadata/store/factory.ts
  - metadata/store/relation-id-insert.ts

Original works
--------------
All other files in this repository are original to this project, including:

  - core/store/pg-store.ts — new PostgreSQL implementation of the IMemoryStore
    interface (patches/pg-store-original.ts is its pre-bugfix revision)
  - core/skill/pg-skill-store.ts — new PostgreSQL implementation of the Skill
    data-access layer
  - metadata/store/postgres-adapter.ts — new PostgresMetadataStore implementing
    the IMetadataStore interface
  - patches/fix-*.js / *.cjs / fix-yaml.py / create-db.js — in-container patch
    application scripts
  - deploy/ — service startup and verification scripts
  - db/schema.sql — PostgreSQL DDL for the storage plane
  - skill-align/ — Skill module PG-alignment verification suite
  - scripts/ + example/ — demo applications

